{
  "comment": "Glyph sets (docs/GLYPHS.md section 3): per family, the SVG of each physical control, named as PadControl in layer/sys/src/input_bindings.cpp (kPadNames), plus prompt-only names (diagonals, whole D-pad). `common` is shared by every family that lists it in `use`; a family's own entries win. `absent` lists the controls a family's pad does not have. Edit, then run tools/make_glyphs.py.",
